    *   *Score:* `0.25`
*   **screen_in**: Base models had basic radio displays. Higher trims might have had a small, dated screen for infotainment, but nothing comparable to modern large touchscreens. Aftermarket upgrades are common (Sources [16, 29, 30]).
    *   *Score:* `-1.00`
